  "text": "proprium.sancti-marci-evangelistae-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Saint Mark the Evangelist” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "O God, Who didst exalt Thy blessed Evangelist Mark, by giving him grace to preach Thine Evangel, grant unto us, we beseech Thee, ever to follow more and more what he teacheth, and ever to be shielded by his prayers. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
